alveolar fricative") _ , and also the [ affricates ](/wiki/Affricate_consonant
"Affricate consonant") _[ ch ](/wiki/Voiceless_postalveolar_affricate
"Voiceless postalveolar affricate") _ and _[ j
](/wiki/Voiced_postalveolar_affricate "Voiced postalveolar affricate") _ , in
rapid succession in a line or passage, creating a harsh and discordant effect.
